# Engine and front ends

`pkg/checker` runs every registered `Site` with a concurrency cap (default 16, `--concurrency`) and a per-check timeout (default 10s). Results stream on a channel. A 429 or known block page becomes `rate_limited` through per-domain backoff.

`cmd/footprint`, the TUI, and `cmd/footprint-mcp` call `Run` and render `Result`. They do not contain site logic.

`scan_email` returns summary counts plus results. A partial run stays partial.

MCP HTTP, if added, binds to localhost unless the user explicitly overrides it. Stdio is the default transport.
